#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All that's on it right now is the school crest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…罰があるのかもな…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつも見てるのか…？
#. それはそれで飽きないのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are they always watching us? Don't they ever get tired\n"
"of it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…と、心の中で挑発するのが精一杯だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, it took everything I had even just to *think*\n"
"about mocking them...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自販機だ…お金は取らないみたいだ。
#. 飲み放題って事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This vending machine doesn't seem to take any money.\n"
"So I guess we can drink as much as we want...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクから、連打してやろうかな！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I kinda hate looking at it... Maybe I should start\n"
"beating up on it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここ、購買部みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yup, this is definitely the school store.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、学校の購買らしくない品揃えだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But there's all kinds of stuff here I wouldn't expect\n"
"to find in a normal school store.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
